.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-container-schedule-run-now - Run a scheduled job now


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro container schedule run-now   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a scheduled job now

.PP
Starts one run now (trigger \fBmanual\fR), whether paused or not; refused with \fBschedule_running\fR while a run of the schedule is going. Returns the run and its job id.

.PP
API: POST /cloud/containers/{id}/schedules/{sched}/run (operationId runContainerScheduleNow, scope services_write)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for run-now

.PP
\fB--idempotency-key\fP=""
	idempotency key (automatic for money operations)


